WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:01.905
This is BiteAtlas.

00:00:01.905 --> 00:00:07.272
A map built around one simple question:
how much of Dhaka have you tasted?

00:00:08.350 --> 00:00:11.987
Three thousand, three hundred and fifty
restaurants.

00:00:11.987 --> 00:00:12.617
Ten maps.

00:00:12.617 --> 00:00:14.086
Seven neighbourhoods.

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:19.521
Every area is traced from real streets,
rivers and rail lines,

00:00:19.521 --> 00:00:22.653
and every restaurant comes from open map
data.

00:00:22.653 --> 00:00:23.743
Nothing scraped.

00:00:23.743 --> 00:00:24.900
Nothing invented.

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:29.353
Pick an area, and a real, living map opens
up.

00:00:29.353 --> 00:00:32.253
Clusters fill with colour as you explore,

00:00:32.253 --> 00:00:35.436
and every pin opens the restaurant's
details.

00:00:36.567 --> 00:00:39.611
Food courts and towers get a single
marker.

00:00:39.611 --> 00:00:43.575
Tap it, and see every restaurant inside,
floor by floor.

00:00:44.700 --> 00:00:45.400
Been there?

00:00:45.400 --> 00:00:46.990
One tap marks it visited.

00:00:46.990 --> 00:00:51.444
Your progress updates instantly, and you
can star the places you love.

00:00:52.567 --> 00:00:54.099
Craving pizza in Gulshan?

00:00:54.099 --> 00:00:58.575
Search finds it as you type, and filters
show what you've visited, saved,

00:00:58.575 --> 00:00:59.863
or still have to try.

00:01:00.967 --> 00:01:04.435
Your dashboard turns it all into a picture
of the city,

00:01:04.435 --> 00:01:07.903
every area filling in as you eat your way
across Dhaka.

00:01:09.033 --> 00:01:10.792
It's made for your phone too.

00:01:10.792 --> 00:01:14.553
A swipe-up sheet, a list view, and no
sign-up needed to start.

00:01:15.700 --> 00:01:20.548
And under the hood: open data, private
accounts, accessibility built in,

00:01:20.548 --> 00:01:22.972
and every feature tested end to end.

00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:24.527
So...

00:01:24.527 --> 00:01:26.749
how much of Dhaka have you tasted?

00:01:26.749 --> 00:01:28.186
Start exploring today.

00:01:28.186 --> 00:01:29.624
The link is on screen.

